<title>UK: CSFB leads $1.183 bln asset-backed issue.</title>
<headline>CSFB leads $1.183 bln asset-backed issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PROVIDAIN MASTER TRUST</p>
<p>SERIES 1997-1 CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $489 MLN	BASE	 LIBOR     MATURITY	.MAY.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+8-9 BP   PAY DATE    17.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   **</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE SET. AVERAGE LIFE 4.99 YEARS</p>
<p>		THERE ARE ALSO CLASS B NOTES OF $57 MLN RATED A2/A,</p>
<p>		TO BE PRICED LIBOR +27-28 BP</p>
<p>SERIES 1997-2 CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $570.5 MLN    BASE	 LIBOR     MATURITY	.MAY.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN   **+10-11 BP PAY DATE    17.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  **	  FULL FEES   **</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    **</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE SET. AVERAGE LIFE 6.99 YEARS</p>
<p>		THERE ARE ALSO CLASS B NOTES OF $66.5 MLN, RATED</p>
<p>		A2/A, TO BE PRICED LIBOR +30 BP AREA</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
